The C++ and JNI files in this directory are taken from the Home Assistant
Android companion app, module microwakeword:

  https://github.com/home-assistant/android

That project is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Kellie's Voice keeps those files so the JNI class name stays
io.homeassistant.companion.android.microwakeword.MicroWakeWord.
TensorFlow Lite Micro, KissFFT, flatbuffers, gemmlowp, and ruy are
downloaded by CMake when an APK is built. They are not vendored here.
